From ce8fb618f2b0f738c6a45ab3eee487018148247a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleg Kulyk <5595029+kami4ka@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:47:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] F1GameStation: 480x272 RGB panel fb, keypad v8, sound
 mode 4, device tree

- rgb480x272fb: TCON0 HV mode for the 480x272 panel, 320x240 RGB565
  shown centred by DEBE layer 0, vsync IRQ for FBIO_WAITFORVSYNC and
  page flips latched at frame start.
- miyoo_kbd: miyoo_ver 8 with one GPIO per button; PA1-PA3 read by
  charge-then-sense; keys held when scanning starts are ignored until
  released.
- miyoo sound: miyoo_snd 4 keeps AMP_EN (PA0) on and skips jack
  detect on PA2.
- suniv-f1c100s-f1gamestation.dts: licheepi-nano UART0 console plus
  the MiyooCFW peripheral nodes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
